<title>POLAND: Indykpol Q2 net rises to PLN 1.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Indykpol Q2 net rises to PLN 1.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indykpol preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.24   vs    1.39</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.69   vs    0.47</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.15   vs    0.28</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Olsztynskie Zaklady Drobiarskie Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     40.57   vs   34.66</p>
<p>    costs of sales			32.83   vs   33.31</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.53   vs    0.18</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.11   vs    0.04</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.67   vs    0.97</p>
<p>    investment			     1.15   vs    1.27</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.09   vs    3.34</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 3.97   vs    1.52</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.58   vs    0.97</p>
<p>    net sales			     76.06   vs   64.27</p>
<p>    costs of sales			61.06   vs   53.95</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.40   vs    0.53</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.16   vs    0.06</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.27   vs    1.88</p>
<p>    investment			     1.88   vs    1.75</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
